IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-GLM-2D-ROPE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-SUBSTRATE-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-K-EXPONENT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
   05 D0-TRIG-SCALE        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 D1-COORDINATE-INPUT.
   05 D1-ORIG-U-COORD      PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
   05 D1-ORIG-V-COORD      PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
   05 D1-TIME-T            PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
01 D2-ROTATED-EMBEDDING.
   05 D2-ROTATED-U         PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
   05 D2-ROTATED-V         PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
   05 D2-RECOVERED-U       PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.
   05 D2-RECOVERED-V       PIC 9(9) USAGE R9.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-PROOF-RULING      PIC 9(9) USAGE R10.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD     PIC 9(9) USAGE R11.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    MOVE 3 TO D0-K-EXPONENT.
    MOVE 10000 TO D0-TRIG-SCALE.

    PERFORM FORWARD-2D-ROPE-TRANSFORM.
    PERFORM INVERSE-2D-ROPE-RECOVERY.
    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.

    IF D2-RECOVERED-U == D1-ORIG-U-COORD AND D2-RECOVERED-V == D1-ORIG-V-COORD
        MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 3 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.

    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

FORWARD-2D-ROPE-TRANSFORM.
    comment Forward 2D-RoPE Rotation: [q_rot] = R · [q_orig];
    COMPUTE D2-ROTATED-U = ((D1-ORIG-U-COORD * 8660) - (D1-ORIG-V-COORD * 5000)) / 10000.
    COMPUTE D2-ROTATED-V = ((D1-ORIG-U-COORD * 5000) + (D1-ORIG-V-COORD * 8660)) / 10000.
    EXIT.

INVERSE-2D-ROPE-RECOVERY.
    comment Inverse 2D-RoPE Orthogonal Reconstruction: [q_rec] = R^T · [q_rot];
    COMPUTE D2-RECOVERED-U = ((D2-ROTATED-U * 8660) + (D2-ROTATED-V * 5000)) / 10000.
    COMPUTE D2-RECOVERED-V = ((-D2-ROTATED-U * 5000) + (D2-ROTATED-V * 8660)) / 10000.
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = D2-ROTATED-U - ((D2-ROTATED-U / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
